---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of use" description="Terms for using Pickora's editorial content and external links." noindex={true}>
  <div class="wrap page-shell">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Terms of use' }]} />
    <article class="prose-page">
      <p class="eyebrow">Draft for owner review · Last updated: 22 October 2026</p>
      <h1>Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="lead">These terms are a working draft for an informational website. Review them for your business and applicable law before launch.</p>
      <h2>Informational content</h2>
      <p>Articles and guides are provided for general information. They are not a substitute for professional advice tailored to your circumstances. Consider your own needs and verify material details with the manufacturer or retailer before purchasing.</p>
      <h2>Product and retailer information</h2>
      <p>Product details, availability, retailer policies and prices may change. Unless a page clearly states otherwise and provides a dated, permitted source, do not treat any price, discount, stock status or product specification as current.</p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>This website may link to independent third-party websites. We do not control their content, services, privacy practices or transactions. A link does not imply endorsement or an official relationship.</p>
      <h2>Intellectual property and corrections</h2>
      <p>Original Pickora text and artwork are provided for personal informational use. Contact the site owner to discuss permissions or report a concern. Contact details must be configured before launch.</p>
      <h2>Changes and review</h2>
      <p>These terms may be revised as the website changes. This draft is not legal advice. The owner should obtain appropriate review before public launch.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
